{"4965960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Operation: Doomed Peter", "steam_appid": 4965960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OPERATION : Doomed Peter is a dungeon crawler heavily inspired by the 80's and 90's games like rogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE PLOT:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once... long ago lived a king,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >up high in his castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In his old age his paranoia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >had gotten to him, no one was</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to visit the king, save for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his favorite familiar,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an orange tabby cat named Peter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This familiar advised the king</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >on all things and helped</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >him rule his kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the evil Mr Bösewicht</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from inside the upside down</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >spire of darkness decided to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >abduct Peter. His goal was to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >throw the kingdom into great</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >duress and then claim it for himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What came next for the people were dark</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >times, could anyone rise to the challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and deliver the kingdom from the grasp</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >of darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key gameplay elements :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose one of six party members to journy along with you and search for the kings lost cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon groups include guns, voodoo magic, melee, and even thrown weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hordes of monsters consisting of over 35 uniqe encounters and 3 bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full six page manual</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4965960/extras/e604009ae7317ae7b2674f23ac7d8d91.avif?t=1785252352\" alt=\"\"width=790 height=602 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamble those schmeckles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4965960/extras/0eb9d3d9b45179f8a60a43416636c17d.avif?t=1785252352\" width=796 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet strangers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And discover stranger places!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4965960/extras/8eba64952910064fe1712455240cf355.avif?t=1785252352\" width=278 height=274 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OPERATION : Doomed Peter is a dungeon crawler heavily inspired by the 80's and 90's games like rogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE PLOT:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once... long ago lived a king,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >up high in his castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In his old age his paranoia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >had gotten to him, no one was</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to visit the king, save for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his favorite familiar,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an orange tabby cat named Peter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This familiar advised the king</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >on all things and helped</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >him rule his kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=